          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most homeowners whose concrete is more than a year old, a blended melter such as Snow Joe Melt-2-Go Nature+ strikes the best balance of speed, price and gentleness. Cryotech CMA suits decorative concrete and anyone prepared to pay more to protect the slab, and Safe Paw or Morton Safe-T-Pet suit homes with pets. Hold calcium chloride back for the coldest mornings on older concrete.
